KNOWNBUG libstdcxx16 libstdcxx
main.cpp
--cpp20 --show-goto-functions
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
dropped the body of system-header function
could not fully type-check
--
With the libstdc++ 16.2.0 headers (g++ 16.2.0), including <format> drops
the body of `__do_vformat_to<_Sink_iter<wchar_t>, wchar_t, ...>' (format
line 5347).  The suppressed diagnostics include "template '__make' not
found" (<compare> lines 208, 304, 308) and the rejection of
error_code's and error_condition's constructor templates for a
partial_ordering argument, and "symbol 'operator==' is unknown" in is_neq.
With the 16-20260315 snapshot that the CI gcc-16 job installs the program
converts.  The same drop fails cpp11_libstdcxx_header_drops/
test_format.desc and test_format_typecheck.desc and
cpp11_namespace_reopened_after_qualified_member_template_definition/
test_libstdcxx.desc.
